From 33884a8b2faccc4b090d4c87441a773c116d980f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:27:50 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Add CPU racers to 3P/4P versus (CVar gPsyCpuRacers, default
 off)

Spawns slots 5-8 (4P) or 4-8 (3P) as CPUs on a second grid row, picks
characters the humans did not, ranks all 8 karts, renders 8 karts per
3P/4P screen (gEncodedKartTexture widened to 4 screens), and ends the
race on the humans' finishing order.
